  - NOT touched: custom_liquid_7HLMyz (feed CSS/HTML/JS, the orphan
    #akTweetContainer, the inert akfeed-field IIFE), ak-top.liquid,
    ak-footer.liquid, all other pages' snippets/templates/assets.

  Revert: in templates/page.narrative.json set custom_liquid_izr6z3
  back to "disabled": true with its original fastbanner liquid (or
